            "data": "training rows: 349590 dates: 2013-02-15 to 2015-12-23 positive share: 0.2509\nvalidation rows: 122801 dates: 2016-01-04 to 2016-12-22 positive share: 0.3251\ntesting rows: 123476 dates: 2017-01-03 to 2017-12-21 positive share: 0.1813\nInput data checks passed.\n"
